  "scope": "Every tool contract in contracts/ is in the inventory. Request violations derived from each input schema (confirmed invalid by jsonschema) are refused by the tool's validation, the shared runtime, MCP and HTTP without running anything. Replies outside each output contract's success domain are refused as INVALID_TOOL_RESULT. Durable executors no longer pass failure codes their contract does not declare (CONTRACT-FAILURE-001): IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT, DATABASE_BUSY and DATABASE_ERROR were added to the durable tools' contracts, and any other internal code becomes INVALID_TOOL_RESULT. A corpus of real failure scenarios stays within the declared codes.",
